{
  "abstract": "Momentum spectra for forward \u03a3\u2212 and \u039e\u2212 production by protons on beryllium are presented. \u03a3\u2212 production data for two primary proton momenta are compared to test scaling of the invariant cross section. In addition, the observed single-particle momentum distributions are compared with single-particle spectra from other inclusive reactions initiated by protons.",
